{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-003#chunk-001", "source_id": "POL-RISK-003", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Missing required field rule", "section_heading": "Purpose", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "## Purpose\n\nDefine the controlled demo rule for required document fields that are missing or explicitly unavailable.", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 302, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-003-missing-required-field.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-003#chunk-002", "source_id": "POL-RISK-003", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Missing required field rule", "section_heading": "Rule", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "## Rule\n\nIf a required MVP document field is missing or cannot be reliably extracted, the case shall produce the `missing_required_field` risk indicator for the affected field.\n\nThe fixed MVP required fields are:\n\n- `customer_name`\n- `address`\n- `document_type`\n- `document_date`\n- `issuer_name`\n- `document_number`\n- `postal_code`\n\n`customer_id` is a reference input rather than a document-required field.", "char_start": 302, "char_end": 710, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-003-missing-required-field.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-003#chunk-003", "source_id": "POL-RISK-003", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Missing required field rule", "section_heading": "Expected finding", "chunk_index": 3, "text": "## Expected finding\n\n- Indicator: `missing_required_field`\n- Affected field: the missing required field\n- Category: `validation`\n- Severity: `warning`", "char_start": 710, "char_end": 862, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-003-missing-required-field.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-003#chunk-004", "source_id": "POL-RISK-003", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Missing required field rule", "section_heading": "Boundary", "chunk_index": 4, "text": "## Boundary\n\nA missing field must not be silently fabricated or treated as successfully verified. This indicator does not determine the final human decision.", "char_start": 862, "char_end": 1021, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-003-missing-required-field.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-003#chunk-005", "source_id": "POL-RISK-003", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Missing required field rule", "section_heading": "Source provenance", "chunk_index": 5, "text": "## Source provenance\n\nThis is project-authored controlled demo content. No external web or regulatory source is used.", "char_start": 1021, "char_end": 1138, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-003-missing-required-field.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-004#chunk-001", "source_id": "POL-RISK-004", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Invalid document date rule", "section_heading": "Purpose", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "## Purpose\n\nDefine the controlled demo rule for an invalid or unusable `document_date`.", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 271, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-004-invalid-document-date.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-004#chunk-002", "source_id": "POL-RISK-004", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Invalid document date rule", "section_heading": "Rule", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "## Rule\n\nIf the extracted `document_date` is missing, cannot be parsed into the configured date representation, or fails the deterministic date validation rule, the case shall produce the `invalid_document_date` risk indicator.", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 500, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-004-invalid-document-date.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
