{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-004#chunk-005", "source_id": "POL-RISK-004", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Invalid document date rule", "section_heading": "Boundary", "chunk_index": 5, "text": "## Boundary\n\nThe rule does not infer a date that is not present in the document. This indicator does not determine the final human decision.", "char_start": 746, "char_end": 888, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-004-invalid-document-date.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-004#chunk-006", "source_id": "POL-RISK-004", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Invalid document date rule", "section_heading": "Source provenance", "chunk_index": 6, "text": "## Source provenance\n\nThis is project-authored controlled demo content. No external web or regulatory source is used.", "char_start": 888, "char_end": 1005, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-004-invalid-document-date.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-005#chunk-001", "source_id": "POL-RISK-005", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Reference customer not found rule", "section_heading": "Purpose", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "## Purpose\n\nDefine the controlled demo rule for a customer reference lookup that does not resolve to a synthetic customer record.", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 327, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-005-reference-customer-not-found.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
