{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-006#chunk-001", "source_id": "POL-RISK-006", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Unsupported document type rule", "section_heading": "Purpose", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "## Purpose\n\nDefine the controlled demo rule for documents whose declared or extracted type is outside the configured MVP document type.", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 327, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-006-unsupported-document-type.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-RISK-006#chunk-002", "source_id": "POL-RISK-006", "version": "1.0.0", "title": "Unsupported document type rule", "section_heading": "Rule", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "## Rule\n\nThe MVP supports one configured document type: a synthetic proof-of-address document.\n\nIf the document type is not the configured MVP proof-of-address type, the case shall produce the `unsupported_document_type` risk indicator.", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 565, "source_path": "data/policy/sources/POL-RISK-006-unsupported-document-type.md", "provenance": {"task_id": "RAG-02", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "generator": "rag-chunking/1.0.0", "corpus_id": "kyc-demo-policy-corpus", "corpus_version": "1.0.0", "source_manifest": "data/policy/manifest.json"}}
